# Per-host dinit environment for kmscon-X11. Optional clipboard bridge.
# Set to the exact Unix socket used by kmscon-clipboard-x11 serve.
# Example for a user with home /home/USER (replace USER):
# KMSCON_CLIPBOARD_SOCKET=/home/USER/.cache/kmscon-clipboard-x11.sock
# Enable/reload/restart kmscon-X11 manually only after peer is available.
